---
variables:
  - name: text
    required: true
  - name: relation_types
    required: false
  - name: confidence_threshold
    required: false
role: resolve.relations
response_format: json_object
---

Extract named entities and the typed relations between them from the text below.

Return a JSON object with exactly these keys:
- "entities": list of {"name": str, "type": str, "context": str}
- "relations": list of {"source": str, "target": str, "type": str, "confidence": float}

Use only the relation types in this list: {{ relation_types | default(['related']) | join(', ') }}.
Only include relations whose confidence is at least {{ confidence_threshold | default(0.0) }}.
If no entities or relations are present, return empty lists.

Text:

{{ text }}
